# PSI Master Evaluation System

`PSI_MASTER.md` is the canonical Knowledge Plane reference artifact for the **PSI Master Evaluation System** within `11_KNOWLEDGE/05_FRAMEWORKS`.

It oversees cross-system integrity audits, structural health grading, and non-compensatory debt assessments.

---

# 1. Master Audit Evaluation Flow

```text
SYSTEM OBSERVATION & TELEMETRY
              │
              ▼
PSI AUDIT GATES:
├── Gate 1: Substrate Depth (No ephemeral hallucinations)
├── Gate 2: Non-Compensatory Balance (No single-factor masking)
├── Gate 3: Authority Separability (Capability != Authority)
└── Gate 4: Zero-Rollback Viability (Pre-computed exit basin)
              │
              ▼
INTEGRITY RECEIPT & COMPLIANCE STAMP
```

